itation or a  statement about it  in truth it's sort of both but more than  anything it's just confused  the film takes a stab at a feminist  message but whatever it's trying to say  gets lost in a web of  shallow characters dead end plot threads  and inexplicable narrative choices  if you just haven't wanted to just take  something back  that being said for all the film's  faults a lack of ambition is not one of  them  there were plenty of bigger than life  action scenes stunning imagery and  genuinely outrageous concepts  we'd much rather that filmmakers take  big swings like this one  even if they miss and fall down in  spectacular fashion  wow  so much for that little experiment  check out one of our newest videos right  here plus  even more looper videos about  over-the-top action movies are coming  soon  subscribe to our youtube channel and hit  the bell so you don't miss a single one  [Music]

